# React/UI conventions

- Prefer **function components** and local state via React hooks.
- Reuse UI primitives in `src/components/ui/*` (e.g. `Button`, `Dialog`, `Toaster`, `TooltipProvider`) instead of rolling custom ones.
- Use Tailwind utility classes; when composing class strings use `cn` from `@/lib/utils` if available in the file’s area.
- Keep components presentational where possible; move side effects / data sync into hooks or store helpers.

## Accessibility & UX

- Interactive elements must have **`type="button"`** for non-submit buttons and meaningful **`aria-*`** / `alt` text.
- Prefer `NavLink` active styling patterns already used in `src/pages/account/Account.tsx`.
- Avoid adding new icon packs; project already uses `lucide-react` and `@phosphor-icons/react`.
